{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":11,"ref":"judges 7:11","book":"judges","lang":"yo","chapter":7,"translation":"Ìwọ sì gbọ́ ohun tí wọ́n bá wí, lẹ́yìn náà làwọ́ rẹ máa lágbára, kí ìwọ lè sọ̀ kalẹ̀ sí ⟨àwọn⟩ ogun. Òun sì sọ̀ kalẹ̀, òun àti Purah ọmọ-ọ̀dọ̀ rẹ, sí etí ⟨àwọn⟩ jagunjagun tí ó wà nínú ⟨àwọn⟩ ogun.","tokens":[{"surface":"ושמעת","gloss":"Ìwọ sì gbọ́"},{"surface":"מה","gloss":"ohun tí"},{"surface":"ידברו","gloss":"wọ́n bá wí"},{"surface":"ואחר","gloss":"lẹ́yìn náà"},{"surface":"תחזקנה","gloss":"máa lágbára"},{"surface":"ידיך","gloss":"àwọ́ rẹ"},{"surface":"וירדת","gloss":"kí ìwọ lè sọ̀ kalẹ̀"},{"surface":"במחנה","gloss":"sí ⟨àwọn⟩ ogun"},{"surface":"וירד","gloss":"Òun sì sọ̀ kalẹ̀"},{"surface":"הוא","gloss":"òun"},{"surface":"ופרה","gloss":"àti Purah"},{"surface":"נערו","gloss":"ọmọ-ọ̀dọ̀ rẹ"},{"surface":"אל","gloss":"sí"},{"surface":"קצה","gloss":"etí"},{"surface":"החמשים","gloss":"⟨àwọn⟩ jagunjagun"},{"surface":"אשר","gloss":"tí ó"},{"surface":"במחנה","gloss":"wà nínú ⟨àwọn⟩ ogun"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-23T00:34:28.153807042Z","model":"glm-5.3"}